OL,3,GNEWSA'He's massive!' Meet Hugo, the
OL,4,Aworld's tallest horse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Shire horse that has entered the
OL,7,Frecord books as the world's tallest
OL,8,Fliving horse could exceed his height as
OL,9,Fhe is still growing, his owner has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FHugo, who lives in Towcester,
OL,13,FNorthamptonshire, has already reached
OL,14,Fan "abnormal" 199cm tall, about 6.5ft
OL,15,Fto the withers or ridge at the base of
OL,16,Fthe neck.
OL,18,FGuinness World Records said the
OL,19,Ffour-year-old's stature was officially
OL,20,Fassessed by a vet and he was measured
OL,21,Fwithout shoes to ensure an accurate
OL,22,Fresult.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
