OL,3,GNEWSA'He's massive!' Meet Hugo, the
OL,4,Aworld's tallest horse
OL,5,
OL,6,FOwner Brett Masters said Hugo received
OL,7,F"a huge amount of care" from a
OL,8,Fchiropractor, dentist, vet and
OL,9,Fmasseuse, meaning he lived a "five-star
OL,10,Flifestyle".
